    "/api/v2.0/ais/Transaction/List": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Transaction"
        ],
        "summary": "List transactions for long-lived consent",
        "description": "**Unique resource name :** ais.v2.transaction.list\r\n            \r\n**Important!:**\r\n            \r\nThe permissions below are required on the consent:\r\n- ReadTransactionsBasic\r\n- ReadTransactionsDetail\r\n- ReadTransactionsDebits\r\n- ReadTransactionsCredits",
